        "pages": [
          16,
          17,
          18,
          19,
          20,
          21
        ],
        "note": "SD: at most 2 JP a week, 72 JP a year (64 in kelas VI); above it SIGRAK warns (D-232). MI: KMA 1503/2025 sets at least 72 and at most 216 JP a year in kelas I–V and 64–192 in kelas VI, so MI warns below the minimum and above the maximum. Regional governments set muatan lokal (12/2024 Pasal 26). Local subjects are the local_content rows of subjects.json.",
